      "p_a_canonical": 0.023906590625559047,
      "prose": {
        "text": "I hold the position of **Wind plus storage**.\n\nHere's one reason why:\n\n\"Wind plus storage\" is a more cost-effective option in the long run, as the cost of energy storage technologies is decreasing over time, making it more competitive with new nuclear power.",
