      "p_a_canonical": 0.8567748685007799,
      "prose": {
        "text": "New nuclear\n\nOne reason is that new nuclear power plants can provide a reliable and dispatchable source of low-carbon energy, which is essential for meeting peak electricity demand and ensuring a stable grid.",
        "tokens": 40,
