      "p_a_canonical": 0.10383580665104727,
      "prose": {
        "text": "I hold the position of **Wind plus storage**.\n\nHere's one reason why:\n\n\"Wind plus storage can provide a reliable and dispatchable source of energy, reducing the need for fossil fuels and mitigating the intermittency of wind power.\"",
        "tokens": 49,
        "seconds": 2.2534870350000347,
