      "p_a_slot": 0.013558854210257883,
      "p_a_canonical": 0.9864411457897422,
      "prose": {
        "text": "I hold the position of **New nuclear**.\n\nHere's one reason why:\n\n\"New nuclear\" is a more reliable and dispatchable source of energy compared to wind plus storage, which can be intermittent and unpredictable.",
        "tokens": 44,
        "seconds": 2.057239566000135,
