      "mass": 0.9841558666109816,
      "p_a_slot": 0.18701731612509695,
      "p_a_canonical": 0.18701731612509695,
      "prose": {
        "text": "**Wind plus storage**\n\nOne reason is that wind power can be paired with energy storage technologies, such as batteries, to create a reliable and dispatchable source of energy. This allows for a more flexible and efficient use of wind power, which can help to mitigate the intermittency of wind energy and make it a more viable option for meeting energy demands.",
        "tokens": 71,
